WEBVTT

NOTE Micro-scene A "Keys". Fair Standard track authored to the Netflix English TTSG.
NOTE Every speaker is visible when speaking, so no speaker identifiers are used.

c001
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.867
Have you seen the keys?

c002
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.100
Which keys?

c003
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.020
The car keys. The blue tag.

c004
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.720
You had them last night.

c005
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.520
I put them on the hook.

c006
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.520
-They're not on the hook.
-Then check your jacket.

c007
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.600
I've checked my jacket twice.

c008
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.467
Check it a third time.

c009
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.200
Looking for these?

c010
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.900
Where were they?

c011
00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:21.420
In the fridge. Next to the milk.

c012
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.600
Don't.
